        "content": "<p>We grow and produce premium organic freeze-dried herbs in Kenya, where year-round sunshine and ideal soils allow continuous cultivation with no seasonal gaps. Through full vertical integration from our own farms to our certified freeze-drying facility we deliver consistent, traceable, and globally compliant herbs trusted by chefs, food-service providers, and private-label brands worldwide. Certified under FSSC 22000 and OU Kosher, with USDA Organic underway, we provide global buyers with reliability they can trust.</p>",
