        "heading": "",
        "content": "<p>Our success is inseparable from the communities we work with. Through our partnership with Freezedry Harvest Kenya, we create sustainable employment and uphold fair-trade practices that strengthen entire households. Every pack of herbs represents real impact farmers earning dignified incomes and operations aligned with global ESG and sustainability standards. We don’t just export herbs; we export opportunity, resilience, and shared prosperity.<br/><br/></p>",
